meta {
  name: Get Prices
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{marketDataBaseUrl}}/api/v1/prices?ticker={{ticker}}&period={{period}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  ticker: {{ticker}}
  period: {{period}}
}

docs {
  Fetches historical daily close prices for a ticker from the Market Data Service.

  The service checks the local DB cache first. Only calls AlphaVantage when data
  is stale (rate limit: 5 requests/min, 25 requests/day on the free plan).

  Query params:
  - ticker  (required) — asset symbol, e.g. "AAPL", "SPY", "MSFT"
  - period  (required) — look-back window: "1m", "3m", "6m", "1y", "2y"

  Response: array of PricePoint objects with date, open, high, low, close, volume.
}
